<document
    `{ theme: { bg: "#fbfbfd" text: "#1d1d1f" } author: goose date: "2026-06-19" }
    <heading `{level: 1} "Q3 report">

    <text "Revenue grew across every region. The quarter total is not pasted in
               as a number — it is the program that produces it, carried inside the
               document:">

    <block `{language: "forth" name: "q3-total"} "120 90 75 + +">

    <text "Press run and the result is written back beside its source as a new
            directive. The document that describes the figure and the document
            that contains the figure are the same value.">
>